Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Dive into a dungeon of 50 floors teeming with countless monsters.<br><br>Gather items and use your special stealth abilities to reach the deepest part, the hidden garden.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147480/extras/b9cf01004244bdbe39bc55609897b66f.apng?t=1773552011\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147480/extras/b9cf01004244bdbe39bc55609897b66f.poster.avif?t=1773552011\" class=\"bb_img\" width=64 height=64 /></picture></span><br><br>Each attempt presents a new challenge as the dungeon's layout and item placements change.<br><br>As you descend, the difficulty escalates with each floor.<br><br>Mind the time limit, and carefully avoid troublesome monsters.<br><br>Make sure to collect essential items and adapt your strategy to the situation.<br><br>With enough practice, conquering all 50 floors is within your grasp.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feedback from Players Who Reached the 50th Floor</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The sense of accomplishment upon reaching the 50th floor in this game is immeasurable. Once you get the hang of it, you can complete it in about 30 minutes.<br></li><li>At first, I thought this game was unreasonable and impossible to beat. However, just by figuring out the right timing to use items, I realized it was actually easy to conquer.<br></li><li>As you progress through the floors, new items, gimmicks, and enemies appear, adding a high level of strategy that is really enjoyable. This game clearly offers more value than its price, and I\u2019ve played it many times.</li></ul>","developers":["OMEME"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147480/header.jpg?t=1773552011","is_free":false,"linux_requirem